---@field entities? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityList The entities in this revision.
---@field entityValidationOutput? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutput The entity validation output for this revision.
---@field revisionId? string The revision id.
---@field provenance? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenance Optional. The history of this revision.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntitiesRevisionList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntitiesRevision[]

---An entity that could be a phrase in the text or a property that belongs to the document. It is a known entity type, such as a person, an organization, or location.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntity
---@field normalizedValue? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityNormalizedValue Optional. Normalized entity value. Absent if the extracted value could not be converted or the type (for example, address) is not supported for certain parsers. This field is also only populated for certain supported document types.
---@field provenance? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenance Optional. The history of this annotation.
---@field textAnchor? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentTextAnchor Optional. Provenance of the entity. Text anchor indexing into the Document.text.
---@field mentionText? string Optional. Text value of the entity, for example, `1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy`.
---@field id? string Optional. Canonical id. This will be a unique value in the entity list for this document.
---@field redacted? boolean Optional. Whether the entity will be redacted for de-identification purposes.
---@field method? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityMethodEnum|string Optional. Specifies how the entity's value is obtained.
---@field pageAnchor? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchor Optional. Represents the provenance of this entity wrt. the location on the page where it was found.
---@field type? string Required. Entity type from a schema, for example, `Address`.
---@field confidence? number Optional. Confidence of detected Schema entity. Range `[0, 1]`.
---@field properties? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityList Optional. Entities can be nested to form a hierarchical data structure representing the content in the document.
---@field mentionId? string Optional. Deprecated. Use `id` field instead.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntity[]

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityMethodEnum "METHOD_UNSPECIFIED"|"EXTRACT"|"DERIVE"

---Parsed and normalized entity value.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityNormalizedValue
---@field integerValue? number Integer value.
---@field dateValue? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleTypeDate Date value. Includes year, month, day. See also: https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis/blob/master/google/type/date.proto
---@field text? string Optional. An optional field to store a normalized string. For some entity types, one of respective `structured_value` fields may also be populated. Also not all the types of `structured_value` will be normalized. For example, some processors may not generate `float` or `integer` normalized text by default. Below are sample formats mapped to structured values. - Money/Currency type (`money_value`) is in the ISO 4217 text format. - Date type (`date_value`) is in the ISO 8601 text format. - Datetime type (`datetime_value`) is in the ISO 8601 text format.
---@field moneyValue? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleTypeMoney Money value. See also: https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis/blob/master/google/type/money.proto
---@field addressValue? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleTypePostalAddress Postal address. See also: https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis/blob/master/google/type/postal_address.proto
---@field booleanValue? boolean Boolean value. Can be used for entities with binary values, or for checkboxes.
---@field floatValue? number Float value.
---@field datetimeValue? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleTypeDateTime DateTime value. Includes date, time, and timezone. See also: https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis/blob/master/google/type/datetime.proto
---@field signatureValue? boolean A signature, which is a graphical representation of a person's name, often used to sign a document.

---Relationship between Entities.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityRelation
---@field objectId? string Object entity id.
---@field subjectId? string Subject entity id.
---@field relation? string Relationship description.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityRelationList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityRelation[]

---The output of the validation given the document and the validation rules.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutput
---@field passAllRules? boolean The overall result of the validation, true if all applicable rules are valid.
---@field validationResults? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutputValidationResultList The result of each validation rule.

---Validation result for a single validation rule.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutputValidationResult
---@field ruleName? string The display name of the validation rule.
---@field rule? string Optional. The name of the rule resource that is used for validation. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/rules/{rule}`
---@field validationDetails? string The detailed information of the running the validation process using the entity from the document based on the validation rule.
---@field ruleDescription? string The description of the validation rule.
---@field validationResultType? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutputValidationResultValidationResultTypeEnum|string The result of the validation rule.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutputValidationResultList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutputValidationResult[]

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentEntityValidationOutputValidationResultValidationResultTypeEnum "VALIDATION_RESULT_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"VALIDATION_RESULT_TYPE_VALID"|"VALIDATION_RESULT_TYPE_INVALID"|"VALIDATION_RESULT_TYPE_SKIPPED"|"VALIDATION_RESULT_TYPE_NOT_APPLICABLE"

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1Document[]

---Config that controls the output of documents. All documents will be written as a JSON file.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentOutputConfig
---@field gcsOutputConfig? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentOutputConfigGcsOutputConfig Output config to write the results to Cloud Storage.

---The configuration used when outputting documents.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentOutputConfigGcsOutputConfig
---@field gcsUri? string The Cloud Storage uri (a directory) of the output.
---@field fieldMask? string Specifies which fields to include in the output documents. Only supports top level document and pages field so it must be in the form of `{document_field_name}` or `pages.{page_field_name}`.
---@field shardingConfig? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentOutputConfigGcsOutputConfigShardingConfig Specifies the sharding config for the output document.

---The sharding config for the output document.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentOutputConfigGcsOutputConfigShardingConfig
---@field pagesPerShard? number The number of pages per shard.
---@field pagesOverlap? number The number of overlapping pages between consecutive shards.

---A page in a Document.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPage
---@field paragraphs? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageParagraphList A list of visually detected text paragraphs on the page. A collection of lines that a human would perceive as a paragraph.
---@field tables? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageTableList A list of visually detected tables on the page.
---@field layout? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageLayout Layout for the page.
---@field transforms? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageMatrixList Transformation matrices that were applied to the original document image to produce Page.image.
---@field visualElements? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageVisualElementList A list of detected non-text visual elements, for example, checkbox, signature etc. on the page.
---@field provenance? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenance The history of this page.
---@field blocks? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageBlockList A list of visually detected text blocks on the page. A block has a set of lines (collected into paragraphs) that have a common line-spacing and orientation.
---@field pageNumber? number 1-based index for current Page in a parent Document. Useful when a page is taken out of a Document for individual processing.
---@field dimension? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDimension Physical dimension of the page.
---@field imageQualityScores? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImageQualityScores Image quality scores.
---@field symbols? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageSymbolList A list of visually detected symbols on the page.
---@field tokens? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageTokenList A list of visually detected tokens on the page.
---@field detectedBarcodes? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedBarcodeList A list of detected barcodes.
---@field detectedLanguages? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedLanguageList A list of detected languages together with confidence.
---@field formFields? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageFormFieldList A list of visually detected form fields on the page.
---@field lines? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageLineList A list of visually detected text lines on the page. A collection of tokens that a human would perceive as a line.
---@field image? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImage Rendered image for this page. This image is preprocessed to remove any skew, rotation, and distortions such that the annotation bounding boxes can be upright and axis-aligned.

---Referencing the visual context of the entity in the Document.pages. Page anchors can be cross-page, consist of multiple bounding polygons and optionally reference specific layout element types.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchor
---@field pageRefs? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchorPageRefList One or more references to visual page elements

---Represents a weak reference to a page element within a document.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchorPageRef
---@field page? string Required. Index into the Document.pages element, for example using `Document.pages` to locate the related page element. This field is skipped when its value is the default `0`. See https://developers.google.com/protocol-buffers/docs/proto3#json.
---@field layoutType? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchorPageRefLayoutTypeEnum|string Optional. The type of the layout element that is being referenced if any.
---@field boundingPoly? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1BoundingPoly Optional. Identifies the bounding polygon of a layout element on the page. If `layout_type` is set, the bounding polygon must be exactly the same to the layout element it's referring to.
---@field layoutId? string Optional. Deprecated. Use PageRef.bounding_poly instead.
---@field confidence? number Optional. Confidence of detected page element, if applicable. Range `[0, 1]`.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchorPageRefLayoutTypeEnum "LAYOUT_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"BLOCK"|"PARAGRAPH"|"LINE"|"TOKEN"|"VISUAL_ELEMENT"|"TABLE"|"FORM_FIELD"

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchorPageRefList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageAnchorPageRef[]

---A block has a set of lines (collected into paragraphs) that have a common line-spacing and orientation.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageBlock
---@field detectedLanguages? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedLanguageList A list of detected languages together with confidence.
---@field layout? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageLayout Layout for Block.
---@field provenance? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenance The history of this annotation.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageBlockList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageBlock[]

---A detected barcode.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedBarcode
---@field barcode? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1Barcode Detailed barcode information of the DetectedBarcode.
---@field layout? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageLayout Layout for DetectedBarcode.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedBarcodeList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedBarcode[]

---Detected language for a structural component.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedLanguage
---@field languageCode? string The [BCP-47 language code](https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr35/#Unicode_locale_identifier), such as `en-US` or `sr-Latn`.
---@field confidence? number Confidence of detected language. Range `[0, 1]`.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedLanguageList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedLanguage[]

---Dimension for the page.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDimension
---@field unit? string Dimension unit.
---@field height? number Page height.
---@field width? number Page width.

---A form field detected on the page.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageFormField
---@field nameDetectedLanguages? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedLanguageList A list of detected languages for name together with confidence.
---@field provenance? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenance The history of this annotation.
---@field fieldValue? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageLayout Layout for the FormField value.
---@field valueDetectedLanguages? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageDetectedLanguageList A list of detected languages for value together with confidence.
---@field correctedKeyText? string Created for Labeling UI to export key text. If corrections were made to the text identified by the `field_name.text_anchor`, this field will contain the correction.
---@field fieldName? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageLayout Layout for the FormField name. For example, `Address`, `Email`, `Grand total`, `Phone number`, etc.
---@field correctedValueText? string Created for Labeling UI to export value text. If corrections were made to the text identified by the `field_value.text_anchor`, this field will contain the correction.
---@field valueType? string If the value is non-textual, this field represents the type. Current valid values are: - blank (this indicates the `field_value` is normal text) - `unfilled_checkbox` - `filled_checkbox`

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageFormFieldList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageFormField[]

---Rendered image contents for this page.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImage
---@field width? number Width of the image in pixels.
---@field mimeType? string Encoding [media type (MIME type)](https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xhtml) for the image.
---@field height? number Height of the image in pixels.
---@field content? string Raw byte content of the image.

---Image quality scores for the page image.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImageQualityScores
---@field qualityScore? number The overall quality score. Range `[0, 1]` where `1` is perfect quality.
---@field detectedDefects? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImageQualityScoresDetectedDefectList A list of detected defects.

---Image Quality Defects
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImageQualityScoresDetectedDefect
---@field confidence? number Confidence of detected defect. Range `[0, 1]` where `1` indicates strong confidence that the defect exists.
---@field type? string Name of the defect type. Supported values are: - `quality/defect_blurry` - `quality/defect_noisy` - `quality/defect_dark` - `quality/defect_faint` - `quality/defect_text_too_small` - `quality/defect_document_cutoff` - `quality/defect_text_cutoff` - `quality/defect_glare`

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImageQualityScoresDetectedDefectList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageImageQualityScoresDetectedDefect[]

