---Font and other text style attributes.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentPageTokenStyleInfo
---@field letterSpacing? number Letter spacing in points.
---@field superscript? boolean Whether the text is a superscript. This feature is not supported yet.
---@field underlined? boolean Whether the text is underlined.
---@field subscript? boolean Whether the text is a subscript. This feature is not supported yet.
---@field fontType? string Name or style of the font.
---@field italic? boolean Whether the text is italic.
---@field backgroundColor? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleTypeColor Color of the background.
---@field fontSize? number Font size in points (`1` point is `¹⁄₇₂` inches).
---@field textColor? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleTypeColor Color of the text.
---@field bold? boolean Whether the text is bold (equivalent to font_weight is at least `700`).
---@field pixelFontSize? number Font size in pixels, equal to _unrounded font_size_ * _resolution_ ÷ `72.0`.
---@field handwritten? boolean Whether the text is handwritten.
---@field strikeout? boolean Whether the text is strikethrough. This feature is not supported yet.
---@field smallcaps? boolean Whether the text is in small caps. This feature is not supported yet.
---@field fontWeight? number TrueType weight on a scale `100` (thin) to `1000` (ultra-heavy). Normal is `400`, bold is `700`.

