---@field type? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenanceTypeEnum|string The type of provenance operation.
---@field parents? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenanceParentList References to the original elements that are replaced.
---@field revision? number The index of the revision that produced this element.
---@field id? number The ID of this operation. Needs to be unique within the scope of the revision.

---@alias gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenanceList gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentProvenance[]

