---@field precision? number The calculated precision.
---@field groundTruthDocumentCount? number The amount of documents with a ground truth occurrence.
---@field recall? number The calculated recall.
---@field predictedOccurrencesCount? number The amount of occurrences in predicted documents.
---@field truePositivesCount? number The amount of true positives.
