---Config for Document OCR.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1OcrConfig
---@field hints? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1OcrConfigHints Hints for the OCR model.
---@field enableSymbol? boolean Includes symbol level OCR information if set to true.
---@field advancedOcrOptions? gcp.documentai_v1.StringList A list of advanced OCR options to further fine-tune OCR behavior. Current valid values are: - `legacy_layout`: a heuristics layout detection algorithm, which serves as an alternative to the current ML-based layout detection algorithm. Customers can choose the best suitable layout algorithm based on their situation.
---@field premiumFeatures? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1OcrConfigPremiumFeatures Configurations for premium OCR features.
---@field computeStyleInfo? boolean Turn on font identification model and return font style information. Deprecated, use PremiumFeatures.compute_style_info instead.
---@field disableCharacterBoxesDetection? boolean Turn off character box detector in OCR engine. Character box detection is enabled by default in OCR 2.0 (and later) processors.
---@field enableNativePdfParsing? boolean Enables special handling for PDFs with existing text information. Results in better text extraction quality in such PDF inputs.
---@field enableImageQualityScores? boolean Enables intelligent document quality scores after OCR. Can help with diagnosing why OCR responses are of poor quality for a given input. Adds additional latency comparable to regular OCR to the process call.

---Hints for OCR Engine
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1OcrConfigHints
---@field languageHints? gcp.documentai_v1.StringList List of BCP-47 language codes to use for OCR. In most cases, not specifying it yields the best results since it enables automatic language detection. For languages based on the Latin alphabet, setting hints is not needed. In rare cases, when the language of the text in the image is known, setting a hint will help get better results (although it will be a significant hindrance if the hint is wrong).

---Configurations for premium OCR features.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1OcrConfigPremiumFeatures
---@field enableMathOcr? boolean Turn on the model that can extract LaTeX math formulas.
---@field computeStyleInfo? boolean Turn on font identification model and return font style information.
---@field enableSelectionMarkDetection? boolean Turn on selection mark detector in OCR engine. Only available in OCR 2.0 (and later) processors.

---Options for Process API
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1ProcessOptions
---@field layoutConfig? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1ProcessOptionsLayoutConfig Optional. Only applicable to `LAYOUT_PARSER_PROCESSOR`. Returns error if set on other processor types.
---@field fromStart? number Only process certain pages from the start. Process all if the document has fewer pages.
---@field fromEnd? number Only process certain pages from the end, same as above.
---@field schemaOverride? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1DocumentSchema Optional. Override the schema of the ProcessorVersion. Will return an Invalid Argument error if this field is set when the underlying ProcessorVersion doesn't support schema override.
---@field ocrConfig? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1OcrConfig Only applicable to `OCR_PROCESSOR` and `FORM_PARSER_PROCESSOR`. Returns error if set on other processor types.
---@field individualPageSelector? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1ProcessOptionsIndividualPageSelector Which pages to process (1-indexed).

---A list of individual page numbers.
---@class gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1ProcessOptionsIndividualPageSelector
