---@field returnImages? boolean Optional. Whether to include images in layout parser processor response.
---@field enableTableAnnotation? boolean Optional. Whether to include table annotations in layout parser response.
---@field enableImageAnnotation? boolean Optional. Whether to include image annotations in layout parser response.
---@field chunkingConfig? gcp.documentai_v1.GoogleCloudDocumentaiV1ProcessOptionsLayoutConfigChunkingConfig Optional. Config for chunking in layout parser processor.

